{"id":67349,"date":"2025-09-17T07:37:27","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T06:37:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67349"},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:53:42","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T20:53:42","slug":"lousa-mountain-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lousa-mountain-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Lousa Mountain Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lousa Mountain Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Lousa Mountain Trail 2027<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>17 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), na freguesia de <strong>Lousa<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Loures<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, secretariado (a partir das <strong>07:00<\/strong>) e partida na <strong>Sede do Grupo Desportivo de Lousa<\/strong> (Rua Her\u00f3is do Ultramar), o evento integra a 3\u00aa etapa do circuito <strong>Merrell Trail Running Series 2026\/27<\/strong> e contempla tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias: <strong>Trail Longo 23 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>), <strong>Trail Curto 13 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>) e <strong>Caminhada 10 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09:05<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos serpenteiam pelas encostas e cabe\u00e7os vulcanizados da freguesia saloia de <strong>Lousa<\/strong> e pelos trilhos florestais e caminhos rurais do norte do concelho de <strong>Loures<\/strong>, oferecendo vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre a v\u00e1rzea e as serras da regi\u00e3o de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. A prova inclui ainda o segmento cronometrado de subida <strong>Merrell Power Zone<\/strong> (registado no Strava) para o Trail Longo e Trail Curto.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Lousa<\/strong> em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>Trail4U<\/strong>, o evento atribui gola oficial, dorsal com chip (nas provas competitivas), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos e pr\u00e9mios aos 3 primeiros da geral M\/F (vouchers de 150 \u20ac, 80 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac), escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios e maior equipa \u00e0s <strong>12:30<\/strong>. Prepara os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sede do Grupo Desportivo de Lousa (Rua Her\u00f3is do Ultramar, Lousa), Loures, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transfo