=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Longo<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Longo 23 km (K23)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto 13 km (K13)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km (K10)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:05<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios de partida do Lousa Mountain Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Lousa Mountain Trail realiza-se no domingo, dia 17 de janeiro de 2027, com partida na Sede do Grupo Desportivo de Lousa (Rua Her\u00f3is do Ultramar, 2670-759 Lousa, concelho de Loures, distrito de Lisboa). O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00, o Trail Longo 23 km e o Trail Curto 13 km partem em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 09:00, a Caminhada 10 km parte \u00e0s 09:05 e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 12:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto pelo Trail Longo de 23 km (destinado a atletas com 18 ou mais anos), pelo Trail Curto de 13 km (a partir dos 16 anos, com autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o do encarregado de educa\u00e7\u00e3o) e pela Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 10 km.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como consultar a tabela de pre\u00e7os?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui gola alusiva ao evento, dorsal com chip integrado (no Trail Longo e Trail Curto; dorsal sem chip na Caminhada), seguro desportivo, apoio m\u00e9dico, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos durante e no final da prova. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 11 de janeiro de 2027 (ou limite de vagas) atrav\u00e9s do formul\u00e1rio oficial, onde s\u00e3o apresentados os valores atualizados por escal\u00e3o\/modalidade.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios e como funciona o circuito Merrell Trail Running Series?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Lousa Mountain Trail \u00e9 a 3\u00aa das 5 etapas do Merrell Trail Running Series 2026\/27. Em cada prova s\u00e3o premiados os 3 primeiros da Geral M\/F do Trail Longo e Trail Curto (com vouchers de 150 \u20ac, 80 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac), os vencedores dos escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Sub-23 a V70+ M\/F), a maior equipa e o vencedor do segmento de subida Merrell Power Zone no Strava (voucher de 50 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Lousa Mountain Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Junta de Freguesia de Lousa (concelho de Loures) em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e desportiva com a entidade promotora Trail4U.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Lousa Mountain Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-17\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sede do Grupo Desportivo de Lousa (Rua Her\u00f3is do Ultramar, Lousa)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Loures\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 5\u00ba Lousa Mountain Trail 2027 realiza-se a 17 de janeiro em Lousa, Loures (Lisboa). Provas de Trail 23 km, 13 km e Caminhada 10 km. Consulta o guia e inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-lousa-mountain-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/lousa-mountain-trail-2027\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Junta de Freguesia de Lousa e Trail4U\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, local e hor\u00e1rios de partida do Lousa Mountain Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Lousa Mountain Trail realiza-se no domingo, dia 17 de janeiro de 2027, com partida na Sede do Grupo Desportivo de Lousa (Rua Her\u00f3is do Ultramar, 2670-759 Lousa, concelho de Loures, distrito de Lisboa). O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:00, o Trail Longo 23 km e o Trail Curto 13 km partem em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 09:00, a Caminhada 10 km parte \u00e0s 09:05 e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 12:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e idades m\u00ednimas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 composto pelo Trail Longo de 23 km (destinado a atletas com 18 ou mais anos), pelo Trail Curto de 13 km (a partir dos 16 anos, com autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o do encarregado de educa\u00e7\u00e3o) e pela Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 10 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e como consultar a tabela de pre\u00e7os?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui gola alusiva ao evento, dorsal com chip integrado (no Trail Longo e Trail Curto; dorsal sem chip na Caminhada), seguro desportivo, apoio m\u00e9dico, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos durante e no final da prova. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 11 de janeiro de 2027 (ou limite de vagas) atrav\u00e9s do formul\u00e1rio oficial, onde s\u00e3o apresentados os valores atualizados por escal\u00e3o\/modalidade.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios e como funciona o circuito Merrell Trail Running Series?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Lousa Mountain Trail \u00e9 a 3\u00aa das 5 etapas do Merrell Trail Running Series 2026\/27. Em cada prova s\u00e3o premiados os 3 primeiros da Geral M\/F do Trail Longo e Trail Curto (com vouchers de 150 \u20ac, 80 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac), os vencedores dos escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Sub-23 a V70+ M\/F), a maior equipa e o vencedor do segmento de subida Merrell Power Zone no Strava (voucher de 50 \u20ac).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Lousa Mountain Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Junta de Freguesia de Lousa (concelho de Loures) em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e desportiva com a entidade promotora Trail4U.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70445,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67349","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-loures-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-lousa-mountain-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67349","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67349"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67349\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70448,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67349\/revisions\/70448"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70445"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=67349"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=67349"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=67349"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=67349"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=67349"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=67349"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=67349"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}